alue","name":"Mode de commercialisation","value":"Abonnement avec devis sur mesure"}]},{"@type":"VideoObject","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/restaurant-touch-cash-register#video","name":"Découvrez la caisse enregistreuse Innovorder","description":"Introducing the Innovorder touchscreen POS solution for restaurants: fast, reliable, and NF525 certified.","thumbnailUrl":"https://img.youtube.com/vi/p2FfNQEfP6w/maxresdefault.jpg","uploadDate":"2024-09-13T09:00:00+02:00","embedUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/p2FfNQEfP6w","contentUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p2FfNQEfP6w"},{"@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.innovorder.com/en/restaurant-touch-cash-register#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Quel est le prix d'une caisse enregistreuse tactile ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Innovorder offers subscription plans for its solutions. To find out the price of a point-of-sale system, contact an Innovorder representative to receive a customized quote tailored to your restaurant’s specific needs."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Comment installer une caisse enregistreuse ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our experts take care of everything. Our team will come to your restaurant to install and set up the POS system and train you on how to use it. All you need is a power cord and an internet connection."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Est-il obligatoire d'être équipé d'une caisse enregistreuse ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Since January 1, 2018, all restaurants subject to VAT that record customer payments using point-of-sale software are required to use secure, certified hardware to combat VAT fraud."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Puis-je personnaliser l'interface de ma caisse enregistreuse ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our cash registers offer great freedom of customization: adapt your keypad layout to the specific needs of your restaurant by modifying menus, categories, and products."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"La caisse enregistreuse est-elle conforme aux réglementations fiscales en vigueur ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All of our cash registers and POS software have complied with the NF525 standard since 2016. A certificate issued by AFNOR guarantees that Innovorder cash registers comply with the law on combating VAT fraud."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"La caisse enregistreuse permet-elle de suivre les ventes en temps réel ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, all sales data is accessible in real time from the back office, enabling instant analysis of performance and optimized decision-making."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"La solution Innovorder est-elle compatible avec des plateformes de livraison comme Uber Eats ou Deliveroo ?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Innovorder POS systems can be connected to delivery platforms like Uber Eats and Deliveroo, allowing for seamless management of online orders directly from your POS system."}}]}]}</script>
