        <div class="container-1280">
          <h2 data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b79" class="h2-prix left">Questions we get asked about<span class="gradient-text"> Atlas:</span></h2>
          <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b7e-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b7e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What data does Atlas analyze in real time?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Atlas centralizes and analyzes all the data generated by your Innovorder ecosystem: revenue, number of orders, average basket size, foot traffic by time slot, product mix, breakdown by sales channel (in-store, click &amp; collect, delivery), and comparative performance of your retail locations. All of this data is updated in real time on your dashboard.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b89-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b89" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How does AI work in Atlas?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Atlas's artificial intelligence, developed using Mistral, continuously analyzes your sales data. It automatically detects performance gaps, anomalies, and opportunities, then generates actionable recommendations ranked by priority based on their estimated impact on your revenue. The AI runs in the background—you don't need to configure anything.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b94-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b94" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">How many retail locations can be managed using Atlas?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Atlas is suitable for organizations of all sizes, from an independent restaurant to a chain with more than 100 locations. For a single location, you’ll have access to the dashboard, sales analytics, and AI recommendations. For a chain, you’ll also have access to a ranking of your locations.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b9f-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064b9f" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">What is the difference between Atlas and the back office?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The back office lets you set up your restaurant (menu, prices, equipment). Atlas lets you manage it: sales analysis, KPI tracking, AI recommendations. The two tools complement each other.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064baa-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="6341893c-46cc-bdb0-793e-fdc3bb064baa" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions">Can Atlas be accessed from a smartphone?</h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Atlas is fully responsive and optimized for smartphones. You can view your dashboard and analyze your sales from your restaurant, your office, or on the go, with the same level of detail as on a computer.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_079ba702-146f-1bf4-c26e-0a326aea3eb6-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="079ba702-146f-1bf4-c26e-0a326aea3eb6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can you track your revenue in real time with Atlas?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Your revenue is updated in real time in the Atlas dashboard, broken down by day, time slot, sales channel, or point of sale. You can track your revenue trends at any time, without needing to export data or wait for a monthly report.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_204841b9-bc50-c52f-7580-a8824c39eab6-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="204841b9-bc50-c52f-7580-a8824c39eab6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does Atlas allow you to track your performance by channel (in-store, click &amp; collect, delivery)?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Atlas provides a unified view of your business across all channels. You can see how your revenue is broken down between dine-in, click-and-collect, and delivery, and identify synergies or cannibalization between channels to adjust your omnichannel strategy.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-db413bcd-9865-c2a5-52db-e027e92bf672-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="db413bcd-9865-c2a5-52db-e027e92bf672" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does Atlas allow you to generate financial reports automatically?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. You can generate your reports with just a few clicks (financial summary, sales analysis by period, accounting export) and schedule automatic email deliveries. Your accountant or management receives the right figures at the right time, without any action on your part.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-e1fbdb9d-d2ab-b119-b220-bc8dbede15a7-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="e1fbdb9d-d2ab-b119-b220-bc8dbede15a7" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can you customize the filters and analysis periods in Atlas?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Atlas allows you to filter your data by time period (day, week, month, year), by retail location, by sales channel, or by consumption type. You can create views tailored to your management needs, from day-to-day monitoring to strategic analysis.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div id="w-node-_87d3549e-e9ff-dd80-eee1-335b0640d3f6-e5a9e9fe" data-w-id="87d3549e-e9ff-dd80-eee1-335b0640d3f6" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
              <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
                <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I display my data as pre-tax and including tax?</strong></h3>
                <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                  <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="accordion-content">
                <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Atlas lets you switch between the "excluding tax" and "including tax" views with a single click across all your dashboards and reports.<br></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
